4. Packages
a collection of pre-defined, reusable functions

CRAN (official app store)

install.packages('package_name')



Bioconductor (for omics analysis)

if (!require("BiocManager", quietly = TRUE)) {
  install.packages("BiocManager")
} else {
  BiocManager::install("DESeq2")
}

Describe what you want to an AI in plain language → get code → run it → fix it → repeat. The point is not to memorize code, but to learn how to direct an AI well.



Before you start vibe coding, you need to know the pattern an AI tends to follow when it writes code.
When you ask Claude for a real analysis, this is the structure you get:

