TipHow to read AI-generated code




Start with main() → get the overall flow (load data → Table 1 → survival analysis → save)
Check each function’s input/output → its arguments and what it returns
Run the functions one at a time → in the RStudio console, start with load_data() and work down
If it breaks, debug just that function → no need to re-run everything

